          {
            "title": "Example: Order",
            "id": 127221,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli i valori corretti in modo che <code>\"Helene\"</code> venga visualizzato per secondo e <code>\"Joe\"</code> per ultimo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showWinners\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(first: String, second: String, third: String)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1st: \\(first)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2nd: \\(second)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;3rd: \\(third)&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showWinners(first: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", second: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helene&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", third: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"178\" endIndex=\"186\" /><option startIndex=\"186\" endIndex=\"187\" /><option startIndex=\"195\" endIndex=\"200\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Mike&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1st: Elaine\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2nd: Helene\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3rd: Joe\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Helene\"</code>, seguito da <code>,</code> e infine <code>\"Joe\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
